      initialEntityId?: string;
      onSaveToProject?: (bundle: RulesetBundle) => Promise<void>;
    }

### UI Layout & Ergonomics
- **Full-Screen Overlay (`fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-[#17191B]/95`):** Closes on `Esc` or `[ X ]` button, restoring focus to the game or Level Editor.
- **Top Bar (48 px):**
  - Module Tabs: `Stats & Formulas` | `Classes & XP` | `Races` | `Spells` | `Items` | `Monsters` | `Party & Live` | `Quick Test`
  - **Validation Pill:** Live badge showing count of errors/warnings (`#B74541`). Clicking opens a jump-to-issue popover (e.g., *"Paladin alignment must be Lawful Good"*, *"Missing worldVisualId on item"*).
  - **Actions:** `Undo (Ctrl+Z)`, `Redo (Ctrl+Y)`, `Import JSON`, `Export JSON`, `Save*`, `HU | EN` language switcher.
- **Left Sidebar (260 px):** Search input (matches both `en` and `hu` labels) + grouped entity tree + `+ Add New` / `Duplicate` / `Delete`.
- **Center Stage:**
  - Uses shared **`SharedNumberField`** (horizontal drag to scrub, click to type, `Shift` for fine step, double-click label to reset).
  - **Classes & XP Tab:** Interactive SVG **XP Curve Graph** comparing all 6 classes (Levels 1–13) above an editable 13-row progression grid (`XP`, `HP Gain`, `THAC0`, `Spell Slots 1–6`).
  - **Party & Live Tab:** Edits premade party presets, AND when `liveRuntime` is connected in-game, shows an **"ACTIVE DUNGEON PARTY"** section where you can tweak live stats, equip any item, add spells, or click **`Full Heal & Restore`** before jumping straight back into 3D combat.
- **Quick Test Tab (`QuickTestPanel.tsx`):**
  - **50-Run Auto-Battle:** Select a Premade Party + Enemy Group, click **`Run 50 Battles`**, and view instant summary cards (`Win Rate %`, `Avg Rounds`, `Party Deaths`, `Enemy Morale Breaks`).
  - **Basic Dice & Check Roller:** Pick any Character, select a Check (`PICK_LOCK`, `FEAR_RESIST`, `THAC0 Attack`) or custom formula (`1d20 + 3`, `2d6`), and click **`Roll`** to inspect the raw dice breakdown.

